{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG COMPANY DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019', 'text': 'KELLOGG COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.57 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 2, 2019. THE EX-DIVIDEND DATE IS NOVEMBER 29, 2019.'}